# The image is built from the package and its metadata only (see Dockerfile). Everything else in a working
# copy (data, keys, virtual environments, caches) is left out of the build context.

# --- Allow only what the image needs -----------------------------------------------------------------------
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/

# --- Even inside src/, never these (should one be left there by mistake) ----------------------------------
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
# keys and secrets
**/*.key
**/*access-key*.txt
**/*masking-key*.txt
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/secrets
# data, real or masked
**/*.csv
**/*.tsv
**/*.parquet
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.zip
**/*.log
